WEBVTT

00:13.740 --> 00:14.730
What?!

00:14.730 --> 00:16.350
What's a human doing there?!

00:16.350 --> 00:17.300
Where's the king?!

00:17.300 --> 00:20.740
It can't be! His Majesty turned into a human?!

00:21.760 --> 00:23.460
Quickly! Come with me!

00:29.030 --> 00:29.760
Sariphi!

00:32.520 --> 00:33.510
Cy!

00:38.630 --> 00:40.550
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:40.950 --> 00:43.720
<i>Why... Why is this happening?</i>

00:45.030 --> 00:47.750
<i>The sky is... blue?!</i>

00:48.020 --> 00:53.030
Flight and the Justice's Ambition

00:56.500 --> 00:59.890
Damn you! What have you 
done to His Majesty?!

00:59.890 --> 01:01.650
Me? Nothing.

01:01.650 --> 01:05.670
Lies! This must have been your scheme!

01:06.200 --> 01:12.100
You visited the forbidden archive to learn 
sinister magics from sealed tomes.

01:13.010 --> 01:17.260
And you used them to trap 
His Majesty in that form!

01:18.710 --> 01:20.680
I always knew you had a keen mind.

01:21.080 --> 01:23.140
However, your reasoning falls a step short.

01:23.140 --> 01:23.990
What?!

01:24.480 --> 01:30.980
I admit that I employed forbidden arts, 
but I've done nothing to the king.

01:30.980 --> 01:36.580
All I did was temporarily dispel 
the miasma that covers this land,

01:36.580 --> 01:40.990
recreating the conditions 
of a night of revelation.

01:41.210 --> 01:44.970
I shouldn't need to remind you 
that on every night of revelation,

01:44.970 --> 01:48.920
the king hides himself away for some reason.

01:48.920 --> 01:51.850
Do you see why that it is now?

01:52.620 --> 01:53.560
How da—

01:53.560 --> 01:56.750
That is what I sought to discover.

01:57.210 --> 02:02.520
A royal secret so great that the king 
needed to hide it at all costs.

02:02.820 --> 02:04.100
Impossible!

02:04.760 --> 02:11.640
You expect me to believe that... 
<i>that</i> is His Majesty's true form?!

02:12.350 --> 02:18.300
Exactly. You've witnessed the 
evidence with your own eyes.

02:18.730 --> 02:22.140
This is the indisputable truth.

02:23.500 --> 02:27.100
Hey, you! What'd you throw Cy at Sari for?!

02:27.100 --> 02:27.800
Moron.

02:28.040 --> 02:30.040
We're gonna follow Sariphi and the king.

02:30.040 --> 02:32.730
Your link to Blob No. 1 will let us...

02:33.510 --> 02:35.870
Wh-What do you guys want?!

02:35.870 --> 02:37.390
What are you doing?!

02:37.390 --> 02:40.210
This emergency is no time for infighting!

02:40.460 --> 02:43.520
Hurry down to the square 
and pacify the people!

02:43.520 --> 02:45.840
We're acting on orders from Justice Set.

02:46.120 --> 02:47.120
Set?

02:47.120 --> 02:48.550
Silence!

02:51.270 --> 02:53.650
I am Justice Set.

02:53.650 --> 02:58.040
Due to these unforeseen circumstances, 
I hereby declare a state of emergency,

02:58.450 --> 03:02.740
during which I will serve as acting king.

03:03.170 --> 03:05.570
<i>Set is taking the king's place?!</i>

03:06.070 --> 03:08.530
<i>What's going on here, Abi?!</i>

03:09.030 --> 03:13.970
There is a reason that Chancellor 
Anubis, who stands with me,

03:13.970 --> 03:16.910
selected me to carry out this great duty.

03:16.910 --> 03:23.010
Namely, that I alone have an accurate 
understanding of our present situation.

03:23.320 --> 03:30.260
The shocking sight that you just 
witnessed was indeed our king.

03:30.530 --> 03:34.810
You saw the other bloodline 
in His Majesty's veins.

03:35.800 --> 03:41.460
Beast and human blood never mix. 
They remain two separate halves.

03:41.730 --> 03:47.280
And when the miasma clears, 
the king's magic weakens greatly,

03:47.280 --> 03:50.340
and he becomes unable to 
maintain his beastly form.

03:51.550 --> 03:54.380
His Majesty is part human?

03:54.380 --> 04:00.250
But the greatest issue is that 
no record or trace attests

04:00.250 --> 04:04.090
to a liaison between our 
previous king and any human.

04:04.090 --> 04:05.280
What?

04:05.280 --> 04:08.350
And the same is true of our previous queen.

04:08.700 --> 04:14.990
In other words, the person we called 
our king has no true royal blood.

04:14.990 --> 04:17.860
He is a fake, plain and simple!

04:18.930 --> 04:22.200
What? That's a lie!

04:22.430 --> 04:27.820
Even more chilling, he sought 
to take a human consort

04:27.820 --> 04:31.750
and usurp the realm of 
beasts with human blood.

04:32.200 --> 04:34.880
That is not our king.

04:34.880 --> 04:37.390
He is an enemy to beastkind!

04:38.560 --> 04:42.480
Now, allow me to issue my 
first order as acting king.

04:43.380 --> 04:47.880
Seize the villain who posed 
as our king this instant,

04:47.880 --> 04:51.860
along with the human girl 
who abetted his escape!

04:55.520 --> 04:57.920
This is the cave you took me to yesterday.

04:57.920 --> 04:59.870
I'm sure we'll be safe here.

05:01.930 --> 05:05.850
<i>They saw. Everyone saw His Majesty's secret.</i>

05:06.540 --> 05:09.350
<i>What now? What should we do?</i>

05:13.200 --> 05:14.270
<i>No.</i>

05:14.880 --> 05:19.180
<i>I don't know why this happened 
or what to do about it,</i>

05:19.180 --> 05:22.080
<i>but His Majesty is more scared 
and uncertain than anyone.</i>

05:22.880 --> 05:24.790
<i>I need to keep it together!</i>

05:26.710 --> 05:29.740
I'll take a look outside. 
Let me borrow your cloak, okay?

05:33.320 --> 05:35.530
The sky is still clear.

05:36.130 --> 05:39.750
I doubt there's anything 
natural about this, girlie.

05:39.750 --> 05:40.270
Huh?

05:40.470 --> 05:44.560
It's a spell or something. 
An artificial force at work.

05:44.560 --> 05:47.990
You mean... someone did this 
to the sky on purpose?

05:48.030 --> 05:49.320
<b>GROWL</b>

05:49.490 --> 05:51.450
<b>GRGL</b>

05:49.490 --> 05:51.450
<b>GRGL</b>

05:49.730 --> 05:52.280
First things first. We need to eat.

05:51.700 --> 05:54.660
<b>GRGL</b>

05:51.700 --> 05:54.660
<b>GRGL</b>

05:52.280 --> 05:55.160
Bennu, keep an eye on His Majesty for me!

05:56.360 --> 05:57.660
There's a town.

05:58.310 --> 06:00.850
I hope I can get some food there.

06:00.850 --> 06:03.170
But if they find out I'm human...

06:04.750 --> 06:07.440
Get in line! You go over here!

06:07.440 --> 06:08.440
Mommy!

06:08.440 --> 06:09.380
Dear!

06:09.380 --> 06:11.580
Is this Amphibian your child?

06:11.580 --> 06:13.910
Yes. My husband is Amphibian.

06:13.910 --> 06:15.760
Why are you dividing everyone up?

06:16.000 --> 06:19.600
Listen well! We are a sorting squad!

06:19.600 --> 06:24.100
We shall divide this town's species in 
accordance with the new class system.

06:24.390 --> 06:28.120
Mammalians are now first-class subjects.

06:28.120 --> 06:30.700
All others will be stripped 
of their right to reside here!

06:30.710 --> 06:32.550
A "sorting squad"?

06:32.550 --> 06:34.900
Are you telling us to get out of town?!

06:34.900 --> 06:37.620
This is the acting king's decree!

06:38.250 --> 06:42.920
We shall rectify the recent policy of 
equality and institute clear distinctions!

06:42.920 --> 06:45.080
This is the new order.

06:45.450 --> 06:47.280
That's ridiculous!

06:47.280 --> 06:51.050
The current king finally made things livable.

06:51.050 --> 06:53.120
That was a deception!

06:53.120 --> 06:58.460
The king preached equality 
to mask his own mixed blood.

06:58.460 --> 07:01.000
It was all a plot by the human king.

07:01.000 --> 07:05.150
To praise the current state of 
things is to support human rule!

07:05.150 --> 07:07.480
But why separate us into different classes?

07:07.480 --> 07:10.650
Can we side with the human king, then?

07:10.650 --> 07:13.630
That way, we can just go 
on with our lives, right?

07:13.630 --> 07:15.790
Hey, what's that supposed to mean?!

07:15.790 --> 07:17.950
As long as <i>you're</i> happy, 
nothing else matters?!

07:18.410 --> 07:21.400
Henceforth, all contact between 
species is prohibited!

07:21.880 --> 07:23.850
Now, get out!

07:23.850 --> 07:25.530
Give back my baby!

07:25.530 --> 07:26.580
Mommy!

07:28.130 --> 07:30.400
Don't touch me, lower-class scum!

07:30.400 --> 07:31.500
Stop!

07:34.370 --> 07:35.510
A human?!

07:35.510 --> 07:37.540
Wh-What's a human doing here?

07:37.540 --> 07:41.180
You must be the girl who ran 
off with the human king!

07:41.180 --> 07:42.810
S-Sari!

07:43.130 --> 07:46.030
He isn't the "human king."

07:46.410 --> 07:48.150
He's <i>your</i> king!

07:49.310 --> 07:54.230
Why do you have to do all this just 
because he has human blood in him?!

07:54.700 --> 07:57.850
His Majesty has been working hard 
for all of you all this time!

07:57.850 --> 08:00.160
Why don't you understand that?!

08:01.240 --> 08:04.710
S-Silence, human! 
We'll execute you here and now!

08:04.710 --> 08:06.210
Sari!

08:08.720 --> 08:09.550
Lante!

08:09.870 --> 08:11.040
Sorry I'm late.

08:13.400 --> 08:14.440
How dare you?!

08:18.630 --> 08:21.580
As if those goons stood a chance against me.

08:21.580 --> 08:25.450
I got special training from the captain 
of the Royal Guard himself.

08:25.450 --> 08:27.710
Cy! Sari!

08:27.710 --> 08:29.150
Thank you, Lante.

08:29.150 --> 08:30.730
Sorry I took so long.

08:30.930 --> 08:31.860
Dear!

08:32.480 --> 08:36.410
Hey, is that any way to act 
after Sariphi saved your—

08:36.410 --> 08:37.190
It's all right.

08:37.190 --> 08:41.700
What? I thought help had arrived, 
but he's working with the human.

08:41.700 --> 08:43.080
What do you expect from a Hyenian?

08:43.770 --> 08:46.830
Let's move, Sariphi. We don't 
want to overstay our welcome.

08:46.830 --> 08:47.580
Right.

08:57.420 --> 08:59.420
Then the "acting king" is...

08:59.420 --> 09:04.950
Yup. That forgettable judge, Set, 
sent those guys you saw in town.

09:04.950 --> 09:06.030
Oh, no.

09:06.530 --> 09:09.130
He might've been setting this up for a while.

09:09.130 --> 09:11.650
It all seems too convenient, you know?

09:11.650 --> 09:14.820
Like everything's playing out 
according to his script.

09:15.150 --> 09:17.530
Then maybe he did this to the sky, too.

09:18.010 --> 09:22.780
Bennu said that someone is deliberately 
invoking magical power.

09:22.780 --> 09:25.740
And if they're using it to 
keep the sky clear, then...

09:25.740 --> 09:27.900
You might be right.

09:27.900 --> 09:33.330
If he figured out the king's secret 
and engineered this situation,

09:33.810 --> 09:38.010
then I can see where his 
crazy speeches came from.

09:38.010 --> 09:39.040
What did he say?

09:39.420 --> 09:44.530
That the king doesn't have royal blood, 
but Set is the last king's kid,

09:45.220 --> 09:48.770
so he's the only real heir to the throne.

09:50.140 --> 09:52.030
"Heir to the throne"?!

09:52.480 --> 09:54.400
How is <i>your</i> blood royal?!

09:54.400 --> 09:56.440
Records testify that it is.

09:56.700 --> 10:00.790
I was born to our late king 
and one of his concubines.

10:01.090 --> 10:04.450
It was merely kept hidden because, 
in a rare exception to the norm,

10:04.450 --> 10:08.990
I take after my mother 
rather than the royal line.

10:09.300 --> 10:11.250
There can be no doubt.

10:11.250 --> 10:14.340
The signature of the archpriest 
of that time is genuine.

10:14.700 --> 10:22.060
So at present, only you have royal blood, 
and that means you should rule?

10:22.350 --> 10:25.190
I'm delighted that you understand.

10:25.190 --> 10:27.560
I didn't expect you to be so open-minded.

10:29.580 --> 10:32.890
Abi, is that why you're standing there?

10:33.330 --> 10:35.980
Is Set the king you serve?

10:36.280 --> 10:36.990
Answer me!

10:37.300 --> 10:39.950
My stance is the same as it has always been.

10:39.950 --> 10:41.660
I am Anubis.

10:41.660 --> 10:45.090
I serve the true king.

10:48.440 --> 10:49.790
I see.

10:49.790 --> 10:53.920
If that's how you do things, 
then I'll take a different path.

10:54.240 --> 10:56.750
<i>He</i> is my one and only king!

10:56.750 --> 10:59.260
I will defend his life!

11:01.680 --> 11:05.220
So you chose his side after all.

11:05.220 --> 11:08.180
Well, I planned for this.

11:08.560 --> 11:11.250
He is a rebel. Seize him.

11:11.760 --> 11:15.770
I can't believe all that happened 
while we were on the run.

11:16.280 --> 11:21.240
If that guy does become king, 
it'll mean civil war in Ozmargo for sure.

11:21.490 --> 11:25.240
Set's a serious supremacist.

11:25.240 --> 11:27.710
And... And what do you think, Lante?

11:27.710 --> 11:28.210
Huh?

11:28.530 --> 11:29.890
About His Majesty.

11:30.210 --> 11:31.610
Nothing much.

11:32.160 --> 11:36.510
I mean, I was surprised, but I honestly 
don't see it as too big a deal.

11:37.070 --> 11:39.710
You're the one I serve, Sariphi.

11:40.350 --> 11:44.060
So the guy you picked is my king. Simple as.

11:44.060 --> 11:46.610
W-We feel the same way!

11:46.610 --> 11:49.630
We'll go with you and the king, Sari!

11:49.630 --> 11:51.570
S-Scary but nice.

11:51.570 --> 11:53.980
Cy, Clops... like the king!

11:55.490 --> 11:59.950
Thank you, Lante, Cy, Clops.

12:01.250 --> 12:08.440
<i>Sire, there </i>are<i> people out there who will 
stay with you, no matter who you are.</i>

12:10.760 --> 12:14.120
We can't keep hiding like this forever.

12:14.520 --> 12:17.700
The only one who can stop a beast civil war

12:17.700 --> 12:19.330
is His Majesty.

12:19.980 --> 12:22.470
We need to get him back on his feet.

12:23.340 --> 12:27.610
But to do that, I need to 
make sure of something:

12:27.610 --> 12:30.470
His Majesty's true roots!

12:32.030 --> 12:34.860
You want clues to where the 
king really comes from?

12:35.220 --> 12:37.230
Can you really find that in the palace?

12:38.730 --> 12:41.320
They're hidden somewhere only I know about.

12:41.820 --> 12:44.920
And because it's so personal to His Majesty,

12:44.920 --> 12:47.950
it wouldn't be right to 
investigate without him.

12:48.200 --> 12:51.910
So we'll have to talk him into it, huh?

12:53.130 --> 12:54.860
All of you, wait here.

13:02.630 --> 13:05.430
Sire, listen.

13:07.490 --> 13:08.460
You see,

13:08.910 --> 13:14.520
that Set person is trying to become king 
and divide all the species into classes.

13:15.350 --> 13:18.480
If this keeps up, beasts will 
end up fighting each other.

13:18.790 --> 13:24.870
Leo, I believe that you're the 
only one who can change all this.

13:25.070 --> 13:29.030
If you discover your roots and rise again,

13:29.030 --> 13:31.590
I know that there are people 
who will accept you.

13:31.590 --> 13:32.460
So...

13:33.610 --> 13:36.040
What do bloodlines matter now?

13:37.610 --> 13:40.070
They've seen me in this form.

13:40.460 --> 13:45.470
I can't protect my people anymore. 
I can't even protect you.

13:45.910 --> 13:49.860
This realm no longer has a place for me.

13:50.990 --> 13:52.130
Sariphi,

13:52.580 --> 13:55.600
come with me to Yoana.

13:57.920 --> 14:00.890
It looks like your military exploits end here,

14:00.890 --> 14:02.930
Captain Jormungand.

14:03.200 --> 14:10.680
A Reptilian like you could never have 
led the Royal Guard under the last king.

14:10.680 --> 14:12.110
And it'll be the same from now—

14:13.220 --> 14:14.410
Princess Amit?!

14:14.880 --> 14:17.500
I... I'll unlock the door.

14:18.500 --> 14:19.890
Please hurry.

14:20.300 --> 14:22.130
Why would you do this?

14:22.590 --> 14:25.580
Y-You're going to seek out 
His Majesty, aren't you?

14:25.860 --> 14:28.910
Please, um, take me with you!

14:29.800 --> 14:30.770
I cannot.

14:31.140 --> 14:33.170
How could I expose you to danger by...

14:33.440 --> 14:35.650
Lady Sariphi will be with him!

14:35.910 --> 14:39.720
And as far as I'm concerned, 
His Majesty is the only king.

14:40.180 --> 14:42.980
I'll do my best to avoid slowing you down.

14:42.980 --> 14:44.930
So please!

14:44.930 --> 14:46.180
Escapees!

14:46.180 --> 14:47.240
Catch them!

14:50.020 --> 14:52.070
Don't leave my side.

14:52.360 --> 14:55.530
I swear that I will protect you.

14:55.750 --> 14:57.340
O-Of course!

14:58.260 --> 15:00.590
<i>Sire, Lady Sariphi,</i>

15:00.590 --> 15:02.340
<i>please be safe!</i>

15:03.800 --> 15:06.510
Just the two of us?

15:07.290 --> 15:13.390
In Yoana—in the human realm—
I can live without hiding myself.

15:13.740 --> 15:17.610
And you won't face prejudice for your race.

15:18.170 --> 15:21.420
Let's live quietly in human lands.

15:22.490 --> 15:25.900
Leo... Is that really what you want?

15:26.290 --> 15:29.050
You're all I need.

15:29.700 --> 15:31.560
As long as I have you, then...

15:40.600 --> 15:44.030
No. You're lying.

15:44.830 --> 15:48.020
If you abandon the Ozmargo 
you've done so much to protect,

15:48.020 --> 15:50.850
can you really be sure 
that you won't regret it?

15:51.580 --> 15:56.640
If you forget this country's people—
everyone who stayed with you—

15:57.050 --> 15:59.120
will you ever be able 
to smile from the heart?

16:00.540 --> 16:02.400
Of course not.

16:02.720 --> 16:05.650
I'll go where you go, Leo.

16:06.260 --> 16:08.070
We'll be together, no matter what!

16:08.460 --> 16:11.900
So please, at least don't lie to yourself.

16:12.230 --> 16:15.540
Don't make me your reason for running away!

16:21.890 --> 16:25.630
Forgive me, Sariphi. It's as you say.

16:26.440 --> 16:29.110
I was about to make another mistake.

16:29.410 --> 16:30.350
"Another" one?

16:33.600 --> 16:36.580
Although a beast, I have human blood.

16:36.990 --> 16:40.300
Although a king, I have a cowardly heart.

16:40.800 --> 16:46.020
I've kept averting my eyes from myself. 
From my contradictions.

16:46.730 --> 16:50.990
My own divisions led to 
divisions in my kingdom.

16:51.500 --> 16:53.440
For that, I will take responsibility.

16:54.200 --> 16:56.110
I'm done running from myself!

16:56.840 --> 16:57.800
Leo...

17:07.670 --> 17:08.550
Are you scared?

17:08.900 --> 17:10.850
Yes, I am.

17:10.850 --> 17:15.500
Both to appear publicly in this form 
and to learn where I come from.

17:16.200 --> 17:18.920
But I'll be all right.

17:22.210 --> 17:23.640
<i>As long as you're with me,</i>

17:25.450 --> 17:27.590
<i>I have nothing to fear.</i>

17:28.650 --> 17:33.290
Oh! I hope Lady Sariphi isn't hurt!

17:33.660 --> 17:36.730
They must be hiding 
themselves from pursuers,

17:36.730 --> 17:40.080
so they may not be easy 
for us to find, either.

17:40.080 --> 17:41.830
Captain Jormungand...

17:42.420 --> 17:45.660
You truly care for your friends, 
Princess Amit.

17:46.060 --> 17:49.120
H-Hardly.

17:49.500 --> 17:52.450
I don't worry about her 
because she's my friend.

17:52.830 --> 17:56.710
I'm her friend because I worry about her.

17:57.100 --> 18:00.000
I suppose so. I'm the same way.

18:00.000 --> 18:00.810
Huh?

18:01.810 --> 18:06.640
In my youth, I dreamed only 
of joining the royal army.

18:07.310 --> 18:10.400
But anti-Reptilian prejudice was strong,

18:10.400 --> 18:13.100
and I was never chosen, 
no matter how many contests I won.

18:13.440 --> 18:15.650
But then, one day...

18:16.560 --> 18:22.120
How many talents like yours have 
been snuffed out due to speciesism?

18:22.540 --> 18:26.110
Just you wait. One day, 
I'll change this kingdom.

18:26.110 --> 18:29.860
Keep your faith in your sword until I do.

18:30.890 --> 18:33.690
His Majesty was as good as his word.

18:33.690 --> 18:35.830
And now, here I am.

18:36.390 --> 18:39.120
I don't serve him because he's my king.

18:39.120 --> 18:43.150
He's my king because I want to serve him.

18:43.810 --> 18:46.510
Forgive me for going on about myself.

18:46.510 --> 18:48.530
N-No, don't apologize!

18:48.940 --> 18:51.870
<i>I'm always happy to hear about you, Captain.</i>

18:52.560 --> 18:53.230
Oh?

18:53.490 --> 18:55.360
Where did these petals come from?

18:55.880 --> 18:57.780
And they haven't withered yet.

18:58.310 --> 19:02.110
Perhaps someone upwind 
is telling their fortune.

19:03.250 --> 19:05.750
Oh, merely something 
Lady Sariphi and I tried.

19:06.200 --> 19:10.460
Wow! Your flowers grew so beautiful, Amit.

19:10.850 --> 19:14.510
They only last one night in Ozmargo,

19:14.510 --> 19:19.230
but in Murga, it's said that fortunes told 
with these flowers often come true.

19:19.230 --> 19:20.560
Really?

19:20.560 --> 19:22.690
Will you tell your future with Jormungand?

19:23.740 --> 19:25.800
I... I couldn't possibly!

19:26.180 --> 19:29.060
<i>I can hardly tell him about </i>that<i>!</i>

19:29.330 --> 19:33.020
Or rather, Lady Sariphi and 
I used these flowers to—

19:33.280 --> 19:34.380
Could it be?!

19:35.250 --> 19:37.190
What're you up to, Sariphi?

19:37.750 --> 19:40.570
We need to gather up firewood to make camp.

19:40.870 --> 19:47.250
I know, but Amit told me that fortunes 
told with this flower often come true.

19:48.400 --> 19:49.510
Pursuers?!

19:49.510 --> 19:50.290
Get back!

19:53.790 --> 19:54.690
Lante?

19:54.690 --> 19:56.080
Captain!

19:56.080 --> 19:56.700
Huh?

19:56.700 --> 19:57.370
Oh!

19:57.370 --> 19:59.970
Lady Sariphi! You're not hurt, are you?!

19:59.970 --> 20:01.180
Amit!

20:01.740 --> 20:04.190
I'm so sorry for worrying you!

20:04.640 --> 20:06.870
I can't believe you found us here.

20:06.870 --> 20:07.660
Yes.

20:08.060 --> 20:11.610
I suppose I should credit 
that to their friendship.

20:13.250 --> 20:16.730
By the way, since you're here, 
does that mean...

20:28.110 --> 20:29.570
Forgive my lateness.

20:30.010 --> 20:35.790
Jormungand, captain of the Royal Guard 
of Ozmargo, at Your Majesty's service.

20:36.810 --> 20:39.510
Welcome, Jormungand.

20:40.580 --> 20:46.810
So, you plan to storm the palace to read 
a diary that you retrieved from Yoana?

20:47.450 --> 20:49.710
Then I will lead the charge.

20:49.710 --> 20:53.770
Set doesn't have the palace 
entirely under his thumb yet.

20:54.320 --> 20:56.800
We are certain to find allies.

20:56.800 --> 21:00.870
Y'know, this'd all be easy if 
the sky went back to normal.

21:01.310 --> 21:05.500
Once the king changes back, 
Set won't stand a chance against him.

21:05.500 --> 21:06.820
That wouldn't do.

21:07.630 --> 21:11.940
For once, force isn't the 
answer to this problem.

21:12.400 --> 21:18.370
It won't mean anything unless I convince 
the people to freely accept me as king.

21:18.770 --> 21:24.200
And if uncovering my roots reveals 
that I truly don't have royal blood,

21:24.530 --> 21:26.290
I will depart this realm.

21:27.550 --> 21:30.710
If it comes to that, I will accompany you.

21:31.280 --> 21:33.040
I would follow you anywhere.

21:35.500 --> 21:39.090
Jormungand and I will storm the palace.

21:39.090 --> 21:43.650
Once I show myself, all eyes will be on me.

21:43.960 --> 21:47.580
And that's when I'll swipe the diary, right?

21:47.580 --> 21:48.650
And me.

21:49.140 --> 21:54.320
I'll go with Lante. I'm the only one 
who knows where the diary's hidden.

21:54.320 --> 21:59.260
L-Lady Sariphi, that's dangerous! 
You should stay with me.

21:59.260 --> 22:02.100
Don't worry. I'll have Lante with me.

22:02.400 --> 22:03.420
So...

22:08.620 --> 22:09.590
Very well.

22:13.740 --> 22:15.730
I'll leave the diary to you.

22:17.280 --> 22:18.050
Right!

22:19.160 --> 22:21.300
Take good care of Sariphi, Lante.

22:21.810 --> 22:25.900
I swear it on my honor as captain 
of the acting queen's guard.

22:31.150 --> 22:34.050
D-Do be careful!

22:34.850 --> 22:36.940
It's time we left, too.

22:36.940 --> 22:37.550
Yes, sire!

22:39.310 --> 22:41.450
Your Highness, please hide yourself.

22:41.900 --> 22:44.200
I am sorry that I cannot remain to guard you.

22:44.410 --> 22:46.670
Don't be. Take care!

22:50.990 --> 22:56.290
<i>So praying for everyone's safety 
like this is still all I can do.</i>

22:58.830 --> 23:00.950
Forgive me, my comrade.

23:02.450 --> 23:03.260
Here, sire.

23:09.530 --> 23:11.650
Lord Set! It's an emergency!

23:12.140 --> 23:13.570
I understand.

23:14.400 --> 23:16.990
<i>Why has he come to me?</i>

23:17.440 --> 23:19.300
Open the gates!

23:19.300 --> 23:21.510
The king of Ozmargo has returned!

23:25.570 --> 23:27.320
I won't be afraid anymore.

23:27.320 --> 23:32.080
Not of this form, not of my blood, 
and especially not of my weak heart.

23:32.080 --> 23:33.530
I will fight.

23:33.530 --> 23:37.490
For the people of this realm, 
for my irreplaceable friends,

23:37.020 --> 23:40.010
Next Episode

23:37.020 --> 23:40.010
The Archpriest and the Truth About the King

23:37.490 --> 23:39.820
and for you, Sariphi!
